=== Concurrent reader follow-up 2026-10-29 ===
Commit: 03eef223bb211222ee21fab6fa3ff558ba5a5da9 (parent 05e0067451798f54f148c954a722bfd16a4e430d)
Code inspection confirms a concurrent wslDistros caller could skip an in-flight probe and return stale or absent state. The fix waits on completion/invalidation channels outside the state lock, rechecks the current list and retries unprobed entries after invalidation. Rescan, observed stop and removal invalidate and wake waiters.
Updated Windows-only event-controlled tests check concurrent results, lock availability, list changes, rescan and observed restart; failure waits use timeouts. Tests were not executed or simulated on Linux, so their behavior and race safety remain unverified.
